{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/javascript-vs-typescript/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Forest_LIM","author":"LIM","siteUrl":"https://logic-phantom.github.io"}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1>JavaScript vs TypeScript: 차이점, 장단점, 그리고 활용 전망</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>이 글은 자바스크립트(JavaScript)와 타입스크립트(TypeScript)의 차이점과 각각의 특징을 이해하고, 타입스크립트의 장단점 및 실무 활용 가능성에 대해 정리한 글입니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>🔍 JavaScript란?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JavaScript</strong>는 웹 브라우저 상에서 실행되는 <strong>스크립트 언어</strong>로, HTML과 CSS와 함께 웹의 3대 요소 중 하나입니다.</li>\n<li>ECMAScript(표준 사양)를 기반으로 하며, Node.js 환경에서는 서버 사이드에서도 사용됩니다.</li>\n<li>동적 타이핑(Dynamic Typing)을 지원합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">Hello, </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>name<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">123</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// => \"Hello, 123\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>🔐 TypeScript란?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TypeScript</strong>는 Microsoft에서 만든 JavaScript의 상위 집합(Superset) 언어입니다.</li>\n<li>정적 타이핑(Static Typing)과 컴파일 타임 검사 기능을 제공합니다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">.ts</code> 확장자를 사용하며, TS 코드를 JS로 트랜스파일(transpile) 하여 실행합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ts\"><pre class=\"language-ts\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">Hello, </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>name<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">123</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// ❌ 컴파일 에러</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>🆚 JavaScript vs TypeScript</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>항목</th>\n<th>JavaScript</th>\n<th>TypeScript</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>타이핑</td>\n<td>동적 타이핑 (런타임 오류)</td>\n<td>정적 타이핑 (컴파일 시점 오류 감지)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>실행 환경</td>\n<td>브라우저, Node.js 등</td>\n<td>컴파일 후 JS로 실행</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>컴파일</td>\n<td>필요 없음</td>\n<td>필요 (tsc로 트랜스파일)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>학습 곡선</td>\n<td>비교적 쉬움</td>\n<td>인터페이스, 제네릭 등으로 인해 다소 높음</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>생산성</td>\n<td>작고 빠른 프로젝트에 유리</td>\n<td>규모가 큰 프로젝트에서 유지보수에 강점</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>도구 지원</td>\n<td>기본적인 IDE 지원</td>\n<td>VSCode와 강력한 타입 추론, 자동완성 지원</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>✅ TypeScript의 장점</h2>\n<p><strong>정적 타입 검사</strong><br>\n코드를 실행하기 전에 버그를 사전에 탐지할 수 있어 안정성이 높습니다.</p>\n<p><strong>IDE 자동완성 &#x26; 코드 인텔리전스</strong><br>\nVSCode에서 함수, 객체, 인터페이스 등에 대한 자동완성 및 타입 힌트를 제공해 생산성이 향상됩니다.</p>\n<p><strong>대규모 프로젝트에 유리</strong><br>\n명확한 인터페이스와 타입 구조로 인해 팀 개발 시 협업이 쉬움.<br>\n리팩토링 시 안정성 보장.</p>\n<p><strong>코드의 문서화 효과</strong><br>\n타입 정보 자체가 개발 문서처럼 동작하여, 코드 이해도가 높아짐.</p>\n<h2>⚠️ TypeScript의 단점</h2>\n<p><strong>초기 설정 비용</strong><br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">tsconfig.json</code>, 타입 선언 파일, Babel/Webpack 등 설정이 복잡할 수 있음.</p>\n<p><strong>학습 난이도</strong><br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">interface</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">enum</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">generics</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">utility types</code> 등 JS보다 개념이 많아 초보자에겐 진입장벽이 있음.</p>\n<p><strong>트랜스파일 필요</strong><br>\n직접 실행되지 않고, 항상 JS로 변환 후 실행되어야 함.</p>\n<h2>🧠 TypeScript 주요 개념 요약</h2>\n<p>🔸 <strong>인터페이스 (Interface)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ts\"><pre class=\"language-ts\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  age<span class=\"token operator\">?</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// optional</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔸 <strong>제네릭 (Generic)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ts\"><pre class=\"language-ts\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token generic-function\"><span class=\"token function\">identity</span><span class=\"token generic class-name\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token constant\">T</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>value<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">T</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">T</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔸 <strong>유니온 타입</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ts\"><pre class=\"language-ts\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">printId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token builtin\">console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔸 <strong>타입 추론 &#x26; 타입 가드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ts\"><pre class=\"language-ts\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">isString</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">unknown</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> x <span class=\"token keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">typeof</span> x <span class=\"token operator\">===</span> <span class=\"token string\">'string'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>🔮 타입스크립트의 활용 전망</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>대규모 서비스</strong>: 프로젝트 규모가 커질수록 코드의 안정성과 유지보수가 중요해지며 TS의 도입률이 급증합니다.</li>\n<li><strong>React/Next.js 생태계</strong>: 최근 대부분의 React/Next.js 템플릿은 기본적으로 TypeScript를 포함하고 있습니다.</li>\n<li><strong>Node.js 백엔드</strong>: Express.js, NestJS 등 Node.js 기반 서버에서도 TS 채택률이 높아지고 있습니다.</li>\n<li><strong>AI 및 오픈소스 도구</strong>: 최근 많은 GPT 기반 오픈소스 툴과 라이브러리도 TypeScript 기반으로 작성됩니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>💬 마무리</h2>\n<p>TypeScript는 코드의 품질, 가독성, 유지보수성을 향상시키는 훌륭한 도구입니다.<br>\n초기에 학습이 다소 필요하지만, 중장기적으로 생산성과 안정성을 크게 향상시킬 수 있어 특히 팀 프로젝트에 강력히 추천됩니다.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>“TypeScript는 자바스크립트의 미래다”</strong> 라는 말은 과장이 아닙니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>다만, 작은 프로젝트에는 과한 설정일 수 있으므로 상황에 맞게 선택하는 것이 중요합니다.</p>\n<h2>📌 추천 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/ko/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TypeScript 공식 문서 (한글)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/typescript-in-5-minutes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TS for JS Developers (공식 핸드북)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/type-challenges/type-challenges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Type Challenges (Advanced TS 문제집)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>","excerpt":"JavaScript vs TypeScript: 차이점, 장단점, 그리고 활용 전망 이 글은 자바스크립트(JavaScript)와 타입스크립트(TypeScript)의 차이점과 각각의 특징을 이해하고, 타입스크립트의 장단점 및 실무 활용 가능성에 대해 정리한 글입니다. 🔍 JavaScript란? JavaScript…","fields":{"slug":"/javascript-vs-typescript/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JavaScript vs TypeScript: 언제 무엇을 사용할까?","summary":"JavaScript와 TypeScript의 비교 및 적절한 사용 시나리오","date":"2025.06.17.","isoDate":"2025-06-17","updatedAt":null,"categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/4d776/TypeScript.png","srcSet":"/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/4a410/TypeScript.png 384w,\n/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/f5189/TypeScript.png 768w,\n/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/4d776/TypeScript.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/b642b/TypeScript.webp 384w,\n/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/c9564/TypeScript.webp 768w,\n/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/18b4b/TypeScript.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"}]},"width":1536,"height":1024}},"publicURL":"/static/2622427d48fae436dd560ffc690d6144/TypeScript.png"}}}}]},"related":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"04b03588-68f6-52db-81cc-a42ba2d2109f","fields":{"slug":"/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🌍 국제화(i18n)와 JavaScript Intl API 완벽 가이드","summary":"무거운 번들 없이 브라우저 내장 API로 끝내는 완벽한 웹 국제화","date":"2026.10.09.","categories":["Web","JavaScript"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/473b7/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.png","srcSet":"/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/be4d9/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.png 192w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/5fc50/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.png 384w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/473b7/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.png 768w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/13e83/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/b3234/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.webp 192w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/65a7c/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.webp 384w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/30053/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.webp 768w,\n/static/1f220406639f36bb2eeea3e9dcdeb178/87027/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"8ae96152-3811-5bc2-bcb1-93c1b670477f","fields":{"slug":"/react-vs-js-structure/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"React 스크립트 구조 vs 순수 JavaScript 스크립트 구조 완벽 비교","summary":"구조 파악해보기","date":"2025.10.16.","categories":["web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/473b7/ReactScr.png","srcSet":"/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/be4d9/ReactScr.png 192w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/5fc50/ReactScr.png 384w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/473b7/ReactScr.png 768w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/13e83/ReactScr.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/b3234/ReactScr.webp 192w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/65a7c/ReactScr.webp 384w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/30053/ReactScr.webp 768w,\n/static/4e07064db6ae2e29ccb9e031dcb6e2b4/87027/ReactScr.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"76104b53-8e0f-58a8-b516-113f7d55363b","fields":{"slug":"/virtual-dom-vs-real-dom/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"⚡ Virtual DOM vs Real DOM 조작 성능 비교","summary":"가상과 현실의 차이","date":"2025.09.05.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/473b7/VirtualDOM.png","srcSet":"/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/be4d9/VirtualDOM.png 192w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/5fc50/VirtualDOM.png 384w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/473b7/VirtualDOM.png 768w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/13e83/VirtualDOM.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/b3234/VirtualDOM.webp 192w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/65a7c/VirtualDOM.webp 384w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/30053/VirtualDOM.webp 768w,\n/static/9efe06695528bb2c4818b1a3027f48d1/87027/VirtualDOM.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"dd985da7-d3f9-53dd-ab85-9a3f1574ddd3","fields":{"slug":"/web-vs-was/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Web vs Was: 언제 무엇을 사용할까?","summary":"Web과 WAS의 차이점과 용도","date":"2025.06.12.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/473b7/webWas.png","srcSet":"/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/be4d9/webWas.png 192w,\n/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/5fc50/webWas.png 384w,\n/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/473b7/webWas.png 768w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/b3234/webWas.webp 192w,\n/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/65a7c/webWas.webp 384w,\n/static/7c41841e447fce0ee04c751f780a1019/30053/webWas.webp 768w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}}]},"siteStats":{"available":true,"posts":[{"path":"/navigation-api-spa-routing-guide/","views":4},{"path":"/gatsby/","views":3},{"path":"/compute-pressure-api-guide/","views":2},{"path":"/popover-api-and-top-layer-guide/","views":2},{"path":"/web-identity-credential-manager-api-guide/","views":2},{"path":"/cloud-tech-overview/","views":1},{"path":"/frontend-observability-opentelemetry-rum/","views":1},{"path":"/islands-architecture-astro-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/supabase_guide/","views":1},{"path":"/vercel/","views":1},{"path":"/view-transitions-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-audio-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-bluetooth-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-locks-api-concurrency-control/","views":1},{"path":"/web-share-target-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/webcodecs-api-guide/","views":1}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/javascript-vs-typescript/","relatedSlugs":["/react-vs-js-structure/","/web-vs-was/","/virtual-dom-vs-real-dom/","/javascript-intl-api-i18n-guide/"]}},"staticQueryHashes":["766300711"],"slicesMap":{}}